\pxi-2.5683,l2.5683,t2.5683;1.^IThis drawing should be read along with our general  Notes, Notes in this drawing, Architectural Drawings   \P^I& Specifications.\P2.^IAll dimensions should be checked by the architect and any discrepancy found should be 
  3
brought to our  notice before execution.\P3.^IAll dimensions are in mm unless otherwise specified.\P4.^IDimensions shall not be measured directly from this  drawing, follow only written dimensions.\P5.^IDo not duplicate any part of this drawing without
  3
 our written permission.\P6.^IGrade of concrete for Pile should be M30 with minimum cement content of 400kg/m{\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;≥} .\P7.^IClear cover to reinforcement a).Pile - 60mm,\P^Ib).Column - 40mm.\P8.^ILap length is 55d, where 'd' is the diame
  3
ter of bar and not more than half the bar shall be spliced at the section.\P9.^ITo ensure building up of pile up to the required level with good concrete, pile has to be built up initially to a length more than that is required and this is to be cut 
  3
off to remove all laitance layer of concrete at its top.\P10.^IThe Pile should be taken into Pile Cap by 75mm.\P11.^IInitial load test on test piles and Routine Load Tests on working pile should be carried out as per I.S 2911 (part 1V)--2013.\P12.^IGra
  1
de of steel shall be Fe 550D.\P13.^IThe building is designed for G + 13 Floors only.  
